<title>USA: Orphan Medical Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Orphan Medical Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter	 Quarter     12 months  12 months</p>
<p>		   Ended	   Ended	   Ended	  Ended</p>
<p>		    12/31/96     12/30/95    12/31/96    12/31/95</p>
<p> Net Loss    $(2,402,868) (1,739,969) (7,617,184) (5,157,947)</p>
<p>Net Loss per Common Share</p>
<p>			  (.40)	 (.47)	(1.43)	(1.89)</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number of Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>		    6,047,137   3,739,588   5,331,356   2,734,680</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the increased loss was due principally to the number of products under development and to the number of clinical trials underway during the quarter.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
